    "name": "Portable Flashing Package: V2.5",
    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=spycemagic%2Fy2-rockbox&amp;tag=v0.2.5-beta#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y2 \u00b7 Stock**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/releases/download/v0.2.5-beta/rom_y2-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/releases/download/v0.2.5-beta/rom_y2-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/releases/download/v0.2.5-beta/rom_y2-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n# Rockbox Y2 V2.5\n\nV2.5 updates the Y2 dual-boot firmware to the official Innioasis **Stock 3.2FM**\nbaseline while retaining Rockbox and Stock boot routes.\n\n## What changed from V2\n\n- Stock mode is updated to version `3.2` from the 3.2FM firmware release.\n- Clean installs default to MacClassic-Dark with a black Rockbox title screen.\n- Boot presentation and route handoff were requalified to prevent persistent\n  upper-screen artifacts.\n- The Community Updater asset is now a complete 3.2FM-based full-ROM package,\n  compatible with the public updater's clean-install route.\n\n## Qualified V2.5 behavior\n\nThe five V2.5 firmware images have passed the full hands-on matrix on macOS and\nWindows:\n\n- Clean, responsive Rockbox root in about 28 seconds on normal cold boots.\n- Clean dark Rockbox title with no persistent upper artifacts.\n- Automatic screen timeout, centre wake, and power-button sleep/wake.\n- USB-storage mount, safe eject, clean return, and foreground retention.\n- Boot Settings switching between Rockbox and Stock.\n- Responsive Stock root reporting version `3.2` from Stock 3.2FM.\n- No microSD card required for installation or normal boot testing.\n\nThe exact public full-ROM archive passed clean Stock 3.2FM installation and the\ncomplete functional matrix on both macOS and Windows.\n\n## Exact public candidate\n\n| Asset | Bytes | SHA-256 |\n|---|---:|---|\n| `rom_y2.zip` | 361,644,736 | `bbdd139a9a52f90570ef04dec4aeb143a361a1d28a90f7be6d37d44c554bee9a` |\n\nThis archive contains the complete official Stock 3.2FM support set. UBOOT,\nBOOTIMG, RECOVERY, LOGO, and ANDROID are the exact V2.5 images already qualified\non both platforms. MBR, EBR1, EBR2, preloader, SEC_RO, cache, userdata, and the\nscatter remain byte-identical to the official 3.2FM baseline.\n\n## Important installation behavior\n\nV2.5 performs a clean full installation and erases internal user data. Back up\nfirst. On macOS, public Updater CE hands the install to the Innioasis Y2 Install\nTool. On Windows, Updater CE uses its full Y2 installation route. Follow every\nconnection prompt and wait for an explicit completion message.\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"bd4b5a195cf676fc406ced3af6504f73ecfbfbb967381258c84bdd83b857adc9\",\"size\":749755883,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"1840523f78466d16e0df6a00b451e63ba10ced908010cb0a7a6b797120b8e056\",\"size\":516344732,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"2dd41d03ce0a9248ffb61476d5e0a72ef48a70d90715da83b2c5468409e47e93\",\"size\":600982850,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-05T11:36:31Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"ba506ca186c16256fcdaa7396c601e9dd7c60d16d5e14aac5f633305bef1b96a\",\"original_assets\":[\"INSTALL-GUIDE.md\",\"LICENSE.txt\",\"NOTICE.txt\",\"README-FIRST.md\",\"RELEASE-NOTES.md\",\"rockbox-y2-v2.5-release-square.png\",\"rom_y2.zip\",\"SHA256SUMS.txt\",\"Y2-Rockbox-V2.5-Source.zip\"],\"skipped\":[],\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"INSTALL-GUIDE.md\":8,\"LICENSE.txt\":8,\"NOTICE.txt\":8,\"README-FIRST.md\":8,\"RELEASE-NOTES.md\":8,\"SHA256SUMS.txt\":4,\"Y2-Rockbox-V2.5-Source.zip\":4,\"rockbox-y2-v2.5-release-square.png\":0,\"rom_y2-linux.zip\":1,\"rom_y2-macos.zip\":3,\"rom_y2-windows.zip\":1,\"rom_y2.zip\":4},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-05T11:36:31Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable.zip\",\"size\":387920108,\"tag\":\"2.5.1\"},\"macos\":{\"name\":\"Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.dmg\",\"size\":154209498,\"tag\":\"2.0.7\"},\"windows\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip\",\"size\":238499367,\"tag\":\"2.5.2\"}},\"v\":11} -->\n",
