    "name": "Portable Flashing Package: Rockbox Y2 Beta V2",
    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=spycemagic%2Fy2-rockbox&amp;tag=v0.2.0-beta#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y2 \u00b7 Stock**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta/Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-UPDATE-ONLY-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta/Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-UPDATE-ONLY-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta/Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-UPDATE-ONLY-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n# Y2 Rockbox Beta V2\n\nBeta V2 is a state-preserving update for Innioasis Y2 players on the official\nStock 3.1.7 lineage. This corrected release has passed separate end-to-end\nmacOS and Windows updater qualifications, complete readback verification, and\nthe full physical functional matrix.\n\n> **Manual-download release:** the files below are public for users who want to\n> download and verify them manually. Direct installation through the public\n> Updater CE catalogue is still pending\n> [Updater CE PR #45](https://github.com/y1-community/Innioasis-Updater/pull/45).\n> Downloading a ZIP manually does not make an old or generic updater safe; use\n> only an updater explicitly carrying the guarded Y2 Class A route.\n\n## Download the exact platform asset\n\n| Platform | Asset | Size | SHA-256 |\n|---|---|---:|---|\n| macOS | `Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-UPDATE-ONLY.zip` | 361,774,260 | `409DDB4D2D18111FB8C3AB619F10F04B916B6B2A3FC04D1D38011324563F326A` |\n| Windows | `Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-Windows-UPDATE-ONLY.zip` | 361,774,260 | `409DDB4D2D18111FB8C3AB619F10F04B916B6B2A3FC04D1D38011324563F326A` |\n\nDo not rename either archive to `rom_y2.zip`. Do not use the withdrawn Beta V2\narchives, the old `InnioasisUpdater_Setup_1.1.2.exe`, or a generic full-format\nroute. Follow `INSTALL-GUIDE.md` and use only an updater explicitly carrying the\nguarded Y2 Class A update path.\n\n## Highlights since Beta V1\n\n- Bluetooth access, pairing and A2DP playback from Rockbox and Stock.\n- Hold Previous/Next to seek; optional held-Volume track skipping.\n- Persistent time/date and independently adjustable Rockbox wheel vibration.\n- Stable Rockbox and Stock USB-storage lifecycle.\n- Cleaner boot presentation and reliable saved Rockbox/Stock routing.\n- Centre wake, long-Centre Now Playing context menu, and improved Back/Database navigation.\n- PictureFlow recovery and functional album carousel.\n\n## Physical acceptance\n\nBoth platform routes began from freshly restored official Stock 3.1.7, wrote\nonly UBOOT, BOOTIMG, RECOVERY, LOGO, and ANDROID, and completed mandatory\nreadback verification. After the required complete unplug and one unplugged\npinhole reset, Rockbox reached a clean responsive root in 28 seconds with no\nupper artifacts. Playback, controls, sleep/wake, USB, Stock, Boot Settings,\nsaved routes, and shutdown passed.\n\n## Known limitation and Beta V3\n\nThe final power-down animation can look imperfect; shutdown itself works. Beta\nV3 is expected to cover that presentation polish plus lyrics/theme diagnostics,\nhigh-resolution FLAC stability, DAC/wired-audio qualification, PictureFlow\npolish, and database/playlist presentation controls.\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-UPDATE-ONLY-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"69d17da661700a07a445b5b2f5c280b038d8280d1df31108bdf8e1e90bfd688a\",\"size\":749887299,\"source_asset\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-UPDATE-ONLY.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-UPDATE-ONLY-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"02d764fbc5f945a23ddb94315665e5d7dbae2b7d29ed317cc5be3cc381f5e5c0\",\"size\":516476231,\"source_asset\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-UPDATE-ONLY.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-UPDATE-ONLY-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"d2efaa0b13ff779aded5a3fb29e7f8512a04354fff06703e439b59319c52f448\",\"size\":601114266,\"source_asset\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-UPDATE-ONLY.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-Windows-UPDATE-ONLY-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"1ec25163d9e9f58648ae938d4a5b365c40a0d3f751d3dcb5d99a671632db54ed\",\"size\":749887299,\"source_asset\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-Windows-UPDATE-ONLY.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-Windows-UPDATE-ONLY-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"ebe9cc128c4e8f9ea818d9c8d2d7433d523345f9c4df20c12e7db3d574321bd4\",\"size\":516476237,\"source_asset\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-Windows-UPDATE-ONLY.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-Windows-UPDATE-ONLY-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"27c5a888c72089a778b556d7a60e78cf70c7b7a707ccd1800b332a1185c8624d\",\"size\":601114266,\"source_asset\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.2.0-Windows-UPDATE-ONLY.zip\",\"type\":\"