    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=spycemagic%2Fy2-rockbox&amp;tag=v0.1.0-beta#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y2 \u00b7 Stock**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta/Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta/Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta/Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/y2-rockbox-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y2 \u00b7 Stock - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\nY2 Rockbox Beta v0.1.0 for the Innioasis Y2.\n\nThis beta uses the physically tested V88 firmware base. The release filename is new, but the firmware ZIP is byte-for-byte identical to the tested V88 package.\n\n## Important\n\nFlashing uses InnioasisUpdater 1.1.2 in full format-download mode and erases the complete player. Back up internal storage, microSD content, settings, playlists, and the complete `.rockbox` folder before flashing. Keep the official Y2 stock-recovery package available.\n\nRead `README-FIRST.txt` and the illustrated PDF guide before starting. Verify every download against `SHA256SUMS.txt`.\n\n## Physically tested\n\n- Rockbox and Stock cold-boot routes\n- Boot Settings save, verification, restart, and repeated cold boots\n- 15-minute audio playback and hardware controls\n- Sleep and wake\n- Theme selection and persistence\n- Internal-storage and microSD playback\n- USB storage transfer, safe eject, and automatic Rockbox return\n- Normal power off\n- Official-stock rollback\n\n## Beta limitations\n\n- Bluetooth playback is untested.\n- The both-volume fastboot chord did not open fastboot; do not rely on it.\n- Date/time changes did not persist during testing; the relationship to stock firmware is unresolved.\n- SNAZZ3 deliberately uses visible 30-pixel margins. This is theme layout, not display scaling.\n- The Windows updater executable is unsigned; verify its SHA-256 before running it.\n\n## Firmware SHA-256\n\n`40636D86943F6F0A1461B6D8C9285A1A50252253447B3DC7D11743533A88E4DE`\n\nThe release includes the complete corresponding source, GPL license, and project notice. Innioasis updater and firmware components remain third-party materials.\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"1f3bb9e2f03351f28f3ee21f1b38b9f47aa537ea65efcd048f0ffc39c51a02b6\",\"size\":749959393,\"source_asset\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"12beb53936e286dbd6daf836d64915fd16d2254e6b80db577b694cb8a0825178\",\"size\":516548253,\"source_asset\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"5c0c002996d63dec2440ecf8f8692a35ecf0931ab61628786bd36c8a6d6600cf\",\"size\":601186360,\"source_asset\":\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"d0250089bcadbef0e3f561f98bf4f899bb5fe46ef55cd949c0cb126c14063838\",\"size\":749959393,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"f728bb18a6127a9a83d3f996e6dc7dc6e0f47633d526009c93e681ee4b9071c4\",\"size\":516548231,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Y2\",\"name\":\"rom_y2-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"be3d9149cafe810d2577f4e972c491114407b7dc12f6e35e0afca608c5083c8d\",\"size\":601186360,\"source_asset\":\"rom_y2.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-05T11:30:52Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"ba932dcb5cddff6caebfd5652bd7dd4b13f61c35821e607b234a198c3e9cbd3f\",\"original_assets\":[\"InnioasisUpdater_Setup_1.1.2.exe\",\"LICENSE.txt\",\"NOTICE.txt\",\"README-FIRST.txt\",\"rom_y2.zip\",\"SHA256SUMS.txt\",\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-Guide.pdf\",\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-Source.zip\",\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater.zip\"],\"skipped\":[],\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"InnioasisUpdater_Setup_1.1.2.exe\":4,\"LICENSE.txt\":4,\"NOTICE.txt\":0,\"README-FIRST.txt\":4,\"SHA256SUMS.txt\":4,\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-Guide.pdf\":4,\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-Source.zip\":4,\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater-linux.zip\":1,\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater-macos.zip\":3,\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater-windows.zip\":1,\"Y2-Rockbox-Beta-v0.1.0-V88-InnioasisUpdater.zip\":0,\